    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Shank, recompiled for Android.\n\nThe app contains no game data: it runs a copy of Shank you own, imported from a folder you pick. The game\'s DXT textures are transcoded to ETC2 on the GPU\'s terms as they are uploaded, so the console\'s data stays untouched.\n\nThe touch controls are a full pad, not a button overlay: every element is yours to move, resize and fade, per orientation.</string>

